{"title":"Career roadmap · Junior AI Engineer","role":"Junior AI Engineer","summary":"A Junior AI Engineer develops, integrates, evaluates and deploys AI/ML systems. The role sits between software engineering, machine learning and applied AI.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Junior AI Engineer develops, integrates, evaluates and deploys AI/ML systems. The role sits between software engineering, machine learning and applied AI."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate specialising in AI & ML, the strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Data structures and algorithms"},{"text":"Mathematics and statistics"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Deep learning"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"APIs and software engineering"},{"text":"Cloud and deployment"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"AI evaluation"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA AI/ML","Python","DSA","Mathematics/Statistics","ML","Deep Learning","GenAI","APIs","Cloud","MLOps","Strong Projects"],"sep":"+","label":"Best-fit combination"},{"type":"p","text":"A BCA can provide a route into junior AI roles, but the candidate needs to compensate for the relatively lighter mathematical depth that some engineering/CS degrees provide. Strong mathematics, programming and deployed projects are therefore particularly important."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Programming + mathematics + CS fundamentals"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"Data science + machine learning"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"Deep learning + GenAI + deployment"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"AI engineering + internship + capstone"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior AI Engineer / ML Engineer / AI Developer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"AI Engineer / ML Engineer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"