ulus"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Derivatives"},{"text":"Partial derivatives"},{"text":"Gradients"},{"text":"Chain rule"},{"text":"Optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Probability and statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Conditional probability"},{"text":"Bayes theorem"},{"text":"Random variables"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Mean/variance"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You don't need to become a pure mathematician, but you should understand the mathematics behind the models you use."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Data and machine learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Python data stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Encoding"},{"text":"Scaling"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Supervised learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"XGBoost/LightGBM concepts"},{"text":"k-NN"},{"text":"SVM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Unsupervised learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"k-Means"},{"text":"DBSCAN"},{"text":"Hierarchical clustering"},{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Dimensionality reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Model evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Train/validation/test split"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Recall"},{"text":"F1"},{"text":"ROC-AUC"},{"text":"PR-AUC"},{"text":"MAE"},{"text":"RMSE"},{"text":"R²"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Most importantly:"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand why a model works or fails rather than only knowing how to call a library function."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Software engineering for AI"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the BCA background becomes a major advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"APIs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST"},{"text":"HTTP"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"API design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Flask"}]},{"type":"p","text":"FastAPI is particularly useful for serving ML models."},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"Redis basics"},{"text":"Vector databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Unit testing"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"Configuration management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Deep learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose PyTorch or TensorFlow/Keras as your primary framework."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neural networks"},{"text":"Forward propagation"},{"text":"Backpropagation"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Loss functions"},{"text":"Regularisation"},{"text":"Batch normalisation"},{"text":"Dropout"},{"text":"Transfer learning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNNs"},{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Object detection"},{"text":"Image segmentation"},{"text":"Transfer learning"},{"text":"Vision transformers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NLP"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tokenisation"},{"text":"Word embeddings"},{"text":"Sequence models"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Text classification"},{"text":"Semantic similarity"}]}]},{"heading":"Generative AI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Junior AI Engineer should understand more than traditional ML."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the LLM stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","Tokenisation","Embeddings","Transformer","LLM","Inference","Evaluation","Application"]},{"type":"h","text":"Topics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Context windows"},{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"Structured outputs"},{"text":"Function/tool calling"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Fine-tuning concepts"},{"text":"LoRA/PEFT"},{"text":"Quantisation"},{"text":"Model evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"RAG systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","Parsing","Chunking","Embeddings","Vector Database","Retrieval","Reranking","LLM","Answer","Evaluation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chunking strategies"},{"text":"Embedding models"},{"text":"Similarity search"},{"text":"Metadata filtering"},{"text":"Hybrid search"},{"text":"Reranking"},{"text":"Retrieval evaluation"},{"text":"Hallucination"},{"text":"Grounded generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI agents"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tool calling"},{"text":"Agent workflows"},{"text":"Planning"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Structured outputs"},{"text":"Multi-step workflows"},{"text":"Agent evaluation"},{"text":"Human-in-the-loop systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Don't treat an AI agent as simply:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLM","prompt","tool."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to measure whether the system actually completes the intended task reliably."}]},{"heading":"AI engineering projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Junior AI En